                        entered once and shared across everything.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#cta">Compare plans</a>
            </div>

            <div class="product-grid">

                <div class="product-card">
                    <div class="product-head">
                        <div class="product-title-row">
                            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4.5" y="4.5" width="15" height="15" rx="4" stroke="#231813" stroke-width="5"></rect><rect x="26" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="6.5" fill="#231813"></rect><rect x="2" y="26" width="20" height="20" rx="6.5" fill="#231813"></rect><circle cx="36" cy="36" r="10" fill="#D55C13"></circle></svg>
                            <div class="product-title">Digital menus</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="product-desc">
                            QR menus guests scan at the table. Multilingual, photo-rich, allergen-aware, and
                            editable mid-service.
                        </div>
                        <div class="tag-row">
                            <span class="tag">QR &amp; table tents</span>
                            <span class="tag">Allergens</span>
                            <span class="tag">Live pricing</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="product-figure">
                        <div class="mini">
                            <div class="mini-tabs">
                                <span class="mini-tab is-active">Antipasti</span>
                                <span class="mini-tab">Primi</span>
                                <span class="mini-tab">Dolci</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mini-dish">
                                <div class="mini-thumb"></div>
                                <div class="mini-name">Burrata &amp; peach</div>
                                <div class="mini-price">€12</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mini-dish">
                                <div class="mini-thumb"></div>
                                <div class="mini-name">Vitello tonnato</div>
                                <div class="mini-price">€14</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="product-card">
                    <div class="product-head">
                        <div class="product-title-row">
                            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="16" rx="5" fill="#231813"></rect><rect x="27" y="6" width="18" height="16" rx="5" stroke="#231813" stroke-width="4"></rect><rect x="3" y="28" width="18" height="14" rx="5" stroke="#231813" stroke-width="4"></rect><rect x="27" y="28" width="18" height="14" rx="5" fill="#D55C13"></rect></svg>
                            <div class="product-title">Management system</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="product-desc">
                            Orders, tables, staff and stock in one dashboard. Multi-branch from day one, with
